/*
  OptimizerSection.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0104 · OptimizerSection (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `OptimizerSection` (and the cost-heatmap it composes) resolves — table
  "OptimizerSection" — lives here with its web value. These entries fold into the
  app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in
  a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys + values extracted from the web sources
  (features/charging/components/charging-list/OptimizerSection.tsx and its composed
  CostHeatmap.tsx), verified against web/src/i18n/en.json (charging.optimizer.*).
  The web `savingsBanner` uses i18next interpolation `${{amount}}`; the native value
  uses the `%@` positional form fed by `String(format:)`. The second group backs the
  native-only chrome (states, freshness banners, day axis, accessibility).
*/

